WEBVTT

00:09:57.961 --> 00:10:01.297
And those two kids, King and Titan,

00:10:01.331 --> 00:10:03.333
mean so much to me.

00:10:03.366 --> 00:10:06.236
And just like my grandparents asked me,

00:10:06.236 --> 00:10:09.339
"What do you want to be
when you grow up?,"

00:10:09.372 --> 00:10:13.610
I want to be able
to hear from my grandsons:

00:10:13.610 --> 00:10:15.778
anything they want to be.

00:10:15.778 --> 00:10:17.080
Thank you for listening.